			"notes": "# Lumi Mace Limiter 1.0.0\n\nA lightweight server-side Fabric mod that enforces a server-wide limit on maces.\n\n## Supported versions\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Minecraft 26.1.2\n- Minecraft 26.2\n\nInstall Fabric Loader and Fabric API, then place the matching jar in the server's `mods` folder.\n\nThe default limit is five maces. Change it in `config/lumimacelimiter.json` or with `/lumimacelimiter cap <number>`.\n\nAvailable admin commands:\n\n- `/lumimacelimiter status`\n- `/lumimacelimiter list`\n- `/lumimacelimiter locate <uuid>`\n- `/lumimacelimiter forget <uuid>`\n- `/lumimacelimiter cap <number>`\n- `/lumimacelimiter reload`\n\nThis project uses the custom Lumi Mace Limiter Shield License 1.0.0. Including the jar in a modpack or server pack requires prior written permission through a repository issue. Linking to this official release does not require permission."
